ing 5 gives 45.", "uncertain": []}, {"skill_tag": "halve_double", "type": "mcq", "difficulty": 3, "stem": "Use halving and doubling to find 48 × 5.", "options": ["240", "230", "250", "220"], "answer": 0, "hints": ["Halve 48 to get 24.", "Double 5 to get 10."], "explanation": "48 × 5 = 24 × 10 = 240.", "misconception": "Halving 5 instead of 48.", "uncertain": []}, {"skill_tag": "halve_double", "type": "mcq", "difficulty": 3, "stem": "Use halving and doubling to find 16 × 25.", "options": ["400", "375", "425", "350"], "answer": 0, "hints": ["Halve 16 to get 8.", "Double 25 to get 50, then double again to get 100? Actually halve 16 twice and double 25 twice."], "explanation": "16 × 25 = 8 × 50 = 4 × 100 = 400.", "misconception": "Halving once and doubling once to get 8 × 50 = 400 (correct) but may forget the second step.", "uncertain": []}, {"skill_tag": "halve_double", "type": "mcq", "difficulty": 4, "stem": "Use halving and doubling to find 28 × 25.", "options": ["700", "675", "725", "650"], "answer": 0, "hints": ["Halve 28 to get 14, then double 25 to get 50.", "Halve 14 to get 7, then double 50 to get 100."], "explanation": "28 × 25 = 14 × 50 = 7 × 100 = 700.", "misconception": "Halving once and doubling once to get 14 × 50 = 700 (correct) but may think 14 × 50 = 650.", "uncertain": []}, {"skill_tag": "distributive", "type": "mcq", "difficulty": 1, "stem": "Use the distributive property to find 6 × 18.", "options": ["108", "90", "112", "102"], "answer": 0, "hints": ["Break 18 into 10 + 8.", "6 × 10 = 60 and 6 × 8 = 48."], "explanation": "6 × 18 = 6 × 10 + 6 × 8 = 60 + 48 = 108.", "misconception": "Adding 6 × 10 + 8 = 68 instead of 6 × 8.", "uncertain": []}, {"skill_tag": "distributive", "type": "mcq", "difficulty": 1, "stem": "Use the distributive property to find 4 × 23.", "options": ["92", "87", "96", "90"], "answer": 0, "hints": ["Break 23 into 20 + 3.", "4 × 20 = 80 and 4 × 3 = 12."], "explanation": "4 × 23 = 4 × 20 + 4 × 3 = 80 + 12 = 92.", "misconception": "Adding 80 + 3 = 83.", "uncertain": []}, {"skill_tag": "distributive", "type": "mcq", "difficulty": 2, "stem": "Use the distributive property to find 7 × 29.", "options": ["203", "196", "207", "210"], "answer": 0, "hints": ["Think 29 = 30 − 1.", "7 × 30 = 210, then subtract 7."], "explanation": "7 × 29 = 7 × 30 − 7 × 1 = 210 − 7 = 203.", "misconception": "Adding 1 instead of subtracting 7.", "uncertain": []}, {"skill_tag": "distributive", "type": "mcq", "difficulty": 2, "stem": "Use the distributive property to find 8 × 16.", "options": ["128", "120", "132", "112"], "answer": 0, "hints": ["Break 16 into 10 + 6.", "8 × 10 = 80 and 8 × 6 = 48."], "explanation": "8 × 16 = 80 + 48 = 128.", "misconception": "Adding 80 + 6 = 86.", "uncertain": []}, {"skill_tag": "distributive", "type": "mcq", "difficulty": 3, "stem": "Use the distributive property to find 9 × 47.", "options": ["423", "413", "427", "400"], "answer": 0, "hints": ["Think 47 = 50 − 3.", "9 × 50 = 450, then subtract 27."], "explanation": "9 × 47 = 9 × 50 − 9 × 3 = 450 − 27 = 423.", "misconception": "Adding 27 instead of subtracting.", "uncertain": []}, {"skill_tag": "distributive", "type": "mcq", "difficulty": 3, "stem": "Use the distributive property to find 12 × 15.", "options": ["180", "160", "190", "175"], "answer": 0, "hints": ["Break 15 into 10 + 5.", "12 × 10 = 120 and 12 × 5 = 60."], "explanation": "12 × 15 = 120 + 60 = 180.", "misconception": "Adding 120 + 5 = 125.", "uncertain": []}, {"skill_tag": "distributive", "type": "mcq", "difficulty": 4, "stem": "Use the distributive property to find 25 × 14.", "options": ["350", "325", "375", "300"], "answer": 0, "hints": ["Break 14 into 10 + 4.", "25 × 10 = 250 and 25 × 4 = 100."], "explanation": "25 × 14 = 250 + 100 = 350.", "misconception": "Adding 250 + 4 = 254.", "uncertain": []}, {"skill_tag": "distributive", "type": "mcq", "difficulty": 4, "stem": "Use the distributive property to find 15 × 38.", "options": ["570", "550", "590", "540"], "answer": 0, "hints": ["Break 38 into 40 − 2.", "15 × 40 = 600, then subtract 30."], "explanation": "15 × 38 = 15 × 40 − 15 × 2 = 600 − 30 = 570.", "misconception": "Adding 30 instead of subtracting.", "uncertain": []}]}